  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>Foolproof cream contour stick that creates an effortless, soft sculpt. Trace-and-blend formula creates subtle definition and lift. Natural finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Stick</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Biomimicry Pigment Technology: Mimics the structure of skin's ceramides for nourishing payoff that lasts. </p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil & Raspberry Leaf Stem Cell Extract: Boosts hydration and moisturizes deeply, allows for seamless blendability.</p><p>- Kaolin Clay: Absorbs excess oil and helps the velvety formula stay in place.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >- Sweep under the cheekbone to define.&nbsp;</p><p>- Gently blend upward and outward with your fingers or a blender brush for more precision.&nbsp;</p><p>- For added dimension, apply on the sides of the nose or along the jawline.</p><p>Gucci's Tip: For the most lift, always keep the contour on the perimeter of your face.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p><b >Highlighted Ingredients:&nbsp;</b></p><p >-Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and allows for seamless blendability.</p><p >-Raspberry Leaf Stem Cell Extract: Boosts hydration, moisturizes deeply.</p><p>-Kaolin Clay: Absorbs excess oil and helps formula stay in place.</p><p><br></p><p>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Kaolin, Caprylyl Caprylate/Caprate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Polyethylene, Mica, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Lecithin, Behenylcarbamoylpropyl Polysilsesquioxane, Tocopherol, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Citric Acid, Rubus Idaeus Leaf Cell Culture. May Contain:, Titanium Dioxide Ci 77891, Iron Oxides Ci 77491, Iron Oxides Ci 77492, Iron Oxides Ci 77499, Red 30 Lake Ci 73360, Blue 1 Lake Ci 42090, Red 7 Lake Ci 15850, Yellow 5 Lake Ci 19140.</p><p><br></p><p>As part of a biomimicry technology system to protect skin, less than 1 percent of silicones found in Baby Cheeks Blush Stick.<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>Foolproof cream contour stick that creates an effortless, soft sculpt. Trace-and-blend formula creates subtle definition and lift. Natural finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Stick</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Biomimicry Pigment Technology: Mimics the structure of skin's ceramides for nourishing payoff that lasts. </p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil & Raspberry Leaf Stem Cell Extract: Boosts hydration and moisturizes deeply, allows for seamless blendability.</p><p>- Kaolin Clay: Absorbs excess oil and helps the velvety formula stay in place.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >- Sweep under the cheekbone to define.&nbsp;</p><p>- Gently blend upward and outward with your fingers or a blender brush for more precision.&nbsp;</p><p>- For added dimension, apply on the sides of the nose or along the jawline.</p><p>Gucci's Tip: For the most lift, always keep the contour on the perimeter of your face.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p><b >Highlighted Ingredients:&nbsp;</b></p><p >-Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and allows for seamless blendability.</p><p >-Raspberry Leaf Stem Cell Extract: Boosts hydration, moisturizes deeply.</p><p>-Kaolin Clay: Absorbs excess oil and helps formula stay in place.</p><p><br></p><p>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Kaolin, Caprylyl Caprylate/Caprate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Polyethylene, Mica, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Lecithin, Behenylcarbamoylpropyl Polysilsesquioxane, Tocopherol, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Citric Acid, Rubus Idaeus Leaf Cell Culture. May Contain:, Titanium Dioxide Ci 77891, Iron Oxides Ci 77491, Iron Oxides Ci 77492, Iron Oxides Ci 77499, Red 30 Lake Ci 73360, Blue 1 Lake Ci 42090, Red 7 Lake Ci 15850, Yellow 5 Lake Ci 19140.</p><p><br></p><p>As part of a biomimicry technology system to protect skin, less than 1 percent of silicones found in Baby Cheeks Blush Stick.<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
